MODULE: ConsumerBatchesRespondViewIgnoresSaturation
TARGET: ConsumerBatchesRespond
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the view ignores the saturated batch response
PERTURBS: ViewShrinkBatch

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.view = ViewBatch(treeVerdict[1])]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: leave the view at full batch size.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.view = FullBatch]
--- END
